<section>
  <heading level="1">8.3 Add and Subtract Rational Expressions with a Common Denominator</heading>
  <heading level="2">Learning Objectives</heading>
  <list type="unordered">
    <item>Add rational expressions with a common denominator</item>
    <item>Subtract rational expressions with a common denominator</item>
    <item>Add and subtract rational expressions whose denominators are opposites</item>
  </list>
  <note type="practice" source_type="Be Prepared" title="Be Prepared" number="8.9">
