  </note>
  <note type="practice" source_type="Be Prepared" title="Be Prepared" number="8.10">
    <paragraph>Subtract: $$\frac{10}{x} - \frac{2}{x}.$$ If you missed this problem, review Example 1.79.</paragraph>
  </note>
  <note type="practice" source_type="Be Prepared" title="Be Prepared" number="8.11">
    <paragraph>Factor completely: $$8n^{5} - 20n^{3}.$$ If you missed this problem, review Example 7.59.</paragraph>
  </note>
  <note type="practice" source_type="Be Prepared" title="Be Prepared" number="8.12">
